    "detailed_description": "Draft Fever Bowl is a competitive <strong>football management simulation</strong> game. <strong>Scout</strong> prospects, make strategic <strong>trades online</strong> and compete for star players on the <strong>draft</strong>.  Every decision counts! <br><br>Climb the ranks, qualify for the Fever Bowl and compete for ultimate glory! Step on the field and see your roster in action through a fully 3D and realistic match engine! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/487c77ad07089972c11bacc3697ab574.avif?t=1743593851\" width=616 height=96 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draft Players!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/c04b9b89b237a2646ed90224fa47cde9.poster.avif?t=1743593851\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/c04b9b89b237a2646ed90224fa47cde9.webm?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/c04b9b89b237a2646ed90224fa47cde9.mp4?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Engage with our comprehensive and immersive drafting system that refreshes every week. Be strategic to secure the best picks, scout through over 100 colleges, and discover hidden gems to enhance your roster.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch the Action!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/2b01dd8816547e95d2d816366a8c636a.poster.avif?t=1743593851\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/2b01dd8816547e95d2d816366a8c636a.webm?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/2b01dd8816547e95d2d816366a8c636a.mp4?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Witness the thrill of the game with our advanced 3D match simulation engine. See your team in action, with each individual player vividly brought to life, showcasing their skills and teamwork on the field.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Online Trades</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/ea0cf1aa9a344d8e434f627f5ccfc985.poster.avif?t=1743593851\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/ea0cf1aa9a344d8e434f627f5ccfc985.webm?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/ea0cf1aa9a344d8e434f627f5ccfc985.mp4?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience a robust trade system that allows you to negotiate and trade picks and players with other users. Your players are unique, collectible cards that you can watch perform in exciting match simulations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Roster!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/91d4c420f3cde8b4fb898422800b2b44.poster.avif?t=1743593851\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/91d4c420f3cde8b4fb898422800b2b44.webm?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/91d4c420f3cde8b4fb898422800b2b44.mp4?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build and manage your dream team by assembling the best players and devising winning strategies. Focus on team synergy and tactical depth to secure victories and climb the competitive ranks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Events!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/1cba9c869b5fee0f1af2b3e3e2998d3a.poster.avif?t=1743593851\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/1cba9c869b5fee0f1af2b3e3e2998d3a.webm?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/1cba9c869b5fee0f1af2b3e3e2998d3a.mp4?t=1743593851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in the dynamic world of &quot;Draft Fever Bowl,&quot; where game events are synchronized with real-life time. Seasons, championships, games, and draft nights are scheduled as live events. Participate in real-time or asynchronously, ensuring you never miss out on the action.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100820/extras/e84a6c31456eb62d0c1425646bf721e4.avif?t=1743593851\" width=616 height=120 /></span>",
